   {
    "attributes": [
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyuN3",
      "name": "Why I'm standing",
      "value": "Having spent years working alongside our community to deliver practical results, including as a councillor and deputy mayor, I know the huge potential our community has. But for too many Nelsonians, life is getting harder. I'm standing because I know that we deserve better. Together we can invest in our communities, restore our nature, build an economy that works for working people, and ensure everyone has what they need to live a good life."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyuPE",
      "name": "About me",
      "value": "Throughout my service to our community, I've demonstrated the ability to deliver real change for Nelsonians. I've built trusted relationships across our region and across traditional political divides and demonstrated the tangible outcomes values-led leadership can bring. Together we've improved public transport with faster, more frequent buses, led record investments in infrastructure, supported more affordable housing, and taken real action to protect our nature and climate. It's those skills and relationships I'll bring to Parliament."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyuRP",
      "name": "Priority 1",
      "value": "Affordable Lives - taxing the rich and lowering your power, grocery, transport and other bills."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyuTa",
      "name": "Priority 2",
      "value": "Healthy Nature - ensuring you can drink, swim, and fish in our oceans and rivers."
     },
     {
      "_key": "RIU5sv1nWnkj6dpEqoyuVl",
      "name": "Priority 3",
      "value": "Decisions in your hands - making sure your voice is heard and felt across government."
     }
    ],
